WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Open a recorded trial. Survive is a movement game used to test Surge’s investigation workflow.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:37.000
See what happened. Replay recorded movement and events on a shared timeline.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Follow the flag. Select a finding to see the replay, measurement, and source records together.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Support the conclusion. Link observations to evidence E1 and document the finding’s limits.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:40.000
Make the work reviewable. Check the evidence and export a report with its source snapshots.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:52.000
Check the control. Compare the speed violation with legal scripted movement.
